So the issue was that one step in the analyzed route has exceeded the speed of 999km/h, which is specified as maximum in simple and complex rate strategy. Therefore, we should probably replace 999 with some reserved value for infinity, like -1, and modify speed rule matcher accordingly.

Also, it's probably a good idea to add logs for null steps, i.e. steps which were generated by route analyzer, but didn't match any of the rate rules. All rate rules should be normally presumed to be exhaustive, so such logs would indicate inconsistencies in rate configurations in search categories.

----

